# Hashed browser builds are copied verbatim and verified by SHA-256 over the
# bytes on disk. Mark them as non-text so Git never rewrites their line endings
# on checkout and a Windows worktree matches the manifest and the site copy.
docs/editor/** -text
docs/live/** -text
# Dossier media is digest-verified for the same reason: every logo and preview
# records a SHA-256 of its bytes, so an EOL rewrite would fail `check` on Windows.
docs/media/** -text
